#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:3
msgid "TERBot"
msgstr "TERBot"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:7
msgid "Role of the class"
msgstr "Rôle de la classe"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:9
msgid "The ``TERBot`` class is the central class of the controller."
msgstr "La classe ``TERBot`` est la classe centrale du contrôleur."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:11
msgid ""
"It represents the robot from a software perspective and coordinates all "
"robot subsystems."
msgstr ""
"Elle représente le robot du point de vue logiciel et coordonne tous les "
"sous-systèmes du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:14
msgid ""
"The main program loop and the robot state machine are implemented in this"
" class."
msgstr ""
"La boucle principale du programme ainsi que la machine à états du robot "
"sont implémentées dans cette classe."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:19
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "Responsabilités"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:21
msgid "Manage the main robot loop."
msgstr "Gérer la boucle principale du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:22
msgid "Read information from the sensors."
msgstr "Lire les informations provenant des capteurs."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:23
msgid "Decide which action to perform according to the current state."
msgstr "Décider de l'action à effectuer selon l'état courant."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:24
msgid "Control the wheels through ``DriveBase``."
msgstr "Commander les roues via ``DriveBase``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:25
msgid "Control the arm and gripper through ``Arm``."
msgstr "Commander le bras et la pince via ``Arm``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:26
msgid "Manage pucks through ``PuckManager``."
msgstr "Gérer les palets via ``PuckManager``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:27
msgid "Manage transitions between the different robot states."
msgstr "Gérer les transitions entre les différents états du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:28
msgid "Apply searching, approaching, avoidance, pickup and drop behaviors."
msgstr ""
"Appliquer les comportements de recherche, d'approche, d'évitement, de "
"ramassage et de dépôt."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:32
msgid "Encapsulation"
msgstr "Encapsulation"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:34
msgid "The ``TERBot`` class encapsulates the global robot logic."
msgstr "La classe ``TERBot`` encapsule la logique globale du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:36
msgid ""
"Its main attributes are private: ``supervisor``, ``driveBase``, "
"``sensors``, ``arm``, ``puckManager``, ``mode``, ``currentPuckIndex`` and"
" ``puckAttached``."
msgstr ""
"Ses attributs principaux sont privés : ``supervisor``, ``driveBase``, "
"``sensors``, ``arm``, ``puckManager``, ``mode``, ``currentPuckIndex`` et "
"``puckAttached``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:40
msgid "The only important public method is ``run()``."
msgstr "La seule méthode publique importante est ``run()``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:42
msgid ""
"The other methods are private because they correspond to internal robot "
"behaviors."
msgstr ""
"Les autres méthodes sont privées, car elles correspondent à des "
"comportements internes du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:47
msgid "Ownership and composition"
msgstr "Possession et composition"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:49
msgid ""
"``TERBot`` owns a ``DriveBase``, a ``RobotSensors``, an ``Arm`` and a "
"``PuckManager``."
msgstr ""
"``TERBot`` possède un ``DriveBase``, un ``RobotSensors``, un ``Arm`` et "
"un ``PuckManager``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:52
msgid "This relationship corresponds to composition."
msgstr "Cette relation correspond à de la composition."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:54
msgid "The software robot is composed of several specialized subsystems."
msgstr ""
"Le robot logiciel est composé de plusieurs sous-systèmes spécialisés."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:58
msgid "State machine"
msgstr "Machine à états"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:60
msgid "The main states are:"
msgstr "Les principaux états sont :"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:62
msgid ""
"``SEARCH``, ``APPROACH_PUCK``, ``LOWER_ARM``, ``CLOSE_GRIPPER``, "
"``LIFT_ARM``, ``GO_TO_DROP_ZONE``, ``DROP_PUCK``, ``TOUCH_AVOID``, "
"``LIFT_ARM_AFTER_DROP`` and ``BACK_AND_TURN_AFTER_DROP``."
msgstr ""
"``SEARCH``, ``APPROACH_PUCK``, ``LOWER_ARM``, ``CLOSE_GRIPPER``, "
"``LIFT_ARM``, ``GO_TO_DROP_ZONE``, ``DROP_PUCK``, ``TOUCH_AVOID``, "
"``LIFT_ARM_AFTER_DROP`` et ``BACK_AND_TURN_AFTER_DROP``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:76
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fonctions"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:79
msgid "``TERBot(Supervisor supervisor)``"
msgstr "``TERBot(Supervisor supervisor)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:81
msgid "Class constructor."
msgstr "Constructeur de la classe."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:83
msgid "It initializes the software robot using the Webots ``Supervisor``."
msgstr ""
"Il initialise le robot logiciel à partir du ``Supervisor`` Webots."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:85
msgid ""
"It stores the ``Supervisor``, retrieves the Webots time step, creates "
"``DriveBase``, ``RobotSensors``, ``Arm`` and ``PuckManager``, then "
"defines the list of pucks to manage."
msgstr ""
"Il stocke le ``Supervisor``, récupère le pas de temps de Webots, crée "
"``DriveBase``, ``RobotSensors``, ``Arm`` et ``PuckManager``, puis "
"définit la liste des palets à gérer."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:90
msgid "``run()``"
msgstr "``run()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:92
msgid "Starts the main robot loop."
msgstr "Lance la boucle principale du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:94
msgid "This method calls ``supervisor.step(timeStep)`` at each iteration."
msgstr ""
"Cette méthode appelle ``supervisor.step(timeStep)`` à chaque itération."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:96
msgid ""
"As long as the simulation is running, the robot continues executing its "
"logic."
msgstr ""
"Tant que la simulation est active, le robot continue à exécuter sa "
"logique."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:99
msgid ""
"If a puck is attached, its position is updated so that it follows the "
"robot, then ``update()`` is called."
msgstr ""
"Si un palet est attaché, sa position est mise à jour pour suivre le "
"robot, puis ``update()`` est appelée."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:103
msgid "``update()``"
msgstr "``update()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:105
msgid "Updates the robot behavior at each simulation step."
msgstr ""
"Met à jour le comportement du robot à chaque pas de simulation."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:107
msgid ""
"This method reads the touch sensor state, handles contacts, executes the "
"behavior corresponding to the current mode, applies wheel speeds, updates"
" the previous touch state and displays debug information."
msgstr ""
"Cette méthode lit l'état du capteur de contact, gère les contacts, "
"exécute le comportement correspondant au mode courant, applique les "
"vitesses aux roues, met à jour l'état précédent du contact et affiche les "
"informations de debug."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:112
msgid "``handleContact(boolean touched)``"
msgstr "``handleContact(boolean touched)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:114
msgid "Handles contacts detected by the front sensor."
msgstr "Gère les contacts détectés par le capteur avant."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:116
msgid ""
"The method distinguishes between contact with a nearby puck and contact "
"with an obstacle."
msgstr ""
"La méthode distingue un contact avec un palet proche et un contact avec "
"un obstacle."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:119
msgid ""
"If the contact corresponds to a puck, the robot switches to ``LOWER_ARM``"
" mode."
msgstr ""
"Si le contact correspond à un palet, le robot passe en mode "
"``LOWER_ARM``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:122
msgid "Otherwise, it switches to ``TOUCH_AVOID`` mode."
msgstr "Sinon, il passe en mode ``TOUCH_AVOID``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:125
msgid "``updateSearch()``"
msgstr "``updateSearch()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:127
msgid "Handles the puck search behavior."
msgstr "Gère le comportement de recherche d'un palet."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:129
msgid ""
"The robot moves forward, monitors the side and front sensors, avoids "
"walls and searches for the nearest available puck."
msgstr ""
"Le robot avance, surveille les capteurs latéraux et avant, évite les "
"murs et cherche le palet disponible le plus proche."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:132
msgid "If a puck is detected, the robot switches to ``APPROACH_PUCK`` mode."
msgstr ""
"Si un palet est détecté, le robot passe en mode ``APPROACH_PUCK``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:134
msgid "The method returns the left and right wheel speeds."
msgstr ""
"La méthode retourne les vitesses gauche et droite."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:137
msgid "``updateTouchAvoid()``"
msgstr "``updateTouchAvoid()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:139
msgid "Handles obstacle avoidance after contact with an obstacle."
msgstr ""
"Gère l'évitement après un contact avec un obstacle."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:141
msgid "The robot moves backward and then turns."
msgstr "Le robot recule, puis tourne."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:143
msgid "Once the sequence is completed, it returns to ``SEARCH`` mode."
msgstr ""
"Une fois la séquence terminée, il revient en mode ``SEARCH``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:146
msgid "``updateApproachPuck()``"
msgstr "``updateApproachPuck()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:148
msgid "Handles the approach toward the targeted puck."
msgstr "Gère l'approche vers le palet ciblé."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:150
msgid ""
"The method computes the direction toward the puck, the current robot "
"orientation and the angular error."
msgstr ""
"La méthode calcule la direction vers le palet, l'orientation actuelle du "
"robot et l'erreur d'angle."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:153
msgid "It then applies a trajectory correction."
msgstr "Elle applique ensuite une correction de trajectoire."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:155
msgid ""
"If the puck is lost or if the approach lasts too long, the robot returns "
"to ``SEARCH`` mode."
msgstr ""
"Si le palet est perdu ou si l'approche dure trop longtemps, le robot "
"revient en mode ``SEARCH``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:159
msgid "``updateGoToDropZone(boolean touched)``"
msgstr "``updateGoToDropZone(boolean touched)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:161
msgid "Handles movement toward the drop zone."
msgstr "Gère le déplacement vers la zone de dépôt."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:163
msgid ""
"The method orients the robot toward the drop position and then moves it "
"forward."
msgstr ""
"La méthode oriente le robot vers la position de dépôt, puis le fait "
"avancer."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:166
msgid ""
"If the robot reaches the drop zone while carrying an attached puck, it "
"switches to ``DROP_PUCK`` mode."
msgstr ""
"Si le robot touche la zone de dépôt avec un palet attaché, il passe en "
"mode ``DROP_PUCK``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:170
msgid "``updateBackAndTurnAfterDrop()``"
msgstr "``updateBackAndTurnAfterDrop()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:172
msgid "Handles the post-drop behavior."
msgstr "Gère le comportement après dépôt."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:174
msgid ""
"The robot moves backward and then turns before returning to ``SEARCH`` "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Le robot recule, puis tourne, avant de revenir en mode ``SEARCH``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:178
msgid "``resetSearch()``"
msgstr "``resetSearch()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:180
msgid "Resets the internal robot state in order to return to search mode."
msgstr ""
"Réinitialise l'état interne du robot pour revenir en mode recherche."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:182
msgid "It resets the mode, counters, current puck and detection indicators."
msgstr ""
"Elle remet à zéro le mode, les compteurs, le palet courant et les "
"indicateurs de détection."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:185
msgid "``printDebug(boolean touched)``"
msgstr "``printDebug(boolean touched)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:187
msgid "Displays useful debug information in the console:"
msgstr ""
"Affiche dans la console les informations utiles au debug :"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:189
msgid "current mode;"
msgstr "mode courant ;"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:190
msgid "sensor values;"
msgstr "valeurs des capteurs ;"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:191
msgid "average color;"
msgstr "couleur moyenne ;"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:192
msgid "touch sensor state;"
msgstr "état du capteur de contact ;"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:193
msgid "attached puck;"
msgstr "palet attaché ;"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:194
msgid "current puck;"
msgstr "palet courant ;"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/terbot.rst:195
msgid "blocking counter."
msgstr "compteur de blocage."